{"3849050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Witch War 1", "steam_appid": 3849050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4910180], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine the elements!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each element can combine with any other element to create a unique effect or be applied as a debuff.  Carry an arsenal of flasks to throw and attune your staff to whichever element you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/3338a0f30fd95004815bf2c73d41ee07.poster.avif?t=1784209700\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/3338a0f30fd95004815bf2c73d41ee07.webm?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/3338a0f30fd95004815bf2c73d41ee07.mp4?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your witch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/68b1eeca8472e63b6f0a7c3a75b40af1.avif?t=1784209700\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras_big/68b1eeca8472e63b6f0a7c3a75b40af1.avif?t=1784209700 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control your army of witches...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over the world by moving your armies to control strategic resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/06dd998d9a64b7c828f861ce212dad04.poster.avif?t=1784209700\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/06dd998d9a64b7c828f861ce212dad04.webm?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/06dd998d9a64b7c828f861ce212dad04.mp4?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...And then choose a battle to join on the front lines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/d486286705134cd8e788a0bd4e02b387.poster.avif?t=1784209700\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/d486286705134cd8e788a0bd4e02b387.webm?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/d486286705134cd8e788a0bd4e02b387.mp4?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAUSE MAYHEM AND CRUSH YOUR ENEMIES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture all of the bases or reduce the opponents reinforcements to 0 before they do the same to you.  The opening state of the battle depends on how many soldiers you send to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/f0d0275c195a74bfd0facdc53603df44.poster.avif?t=1784209700\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/f0d0275c195a74bfd0facdc53603df44.webm?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/f0d0275c195a74bfd0facdc53603df44.mp4?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You don't have to fight alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your witch army is here to assist!  Or perhaps you prefer to recruit your friends in online co-op*?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*friends not included</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine the elements!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each element can combine with any other element to create a unique effect or be applied as a debuff.  Carry an arsenal of flasks to throw and attune your staff to whichever element you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/3338a0f30fd95004815bf2c73d41ee07.poster.avif?t=1784209700\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/3338a0f30fd95004815bf2c73d41ee07.webm?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/3338a0f30fd95004815bf2c73d41ee07.mp4?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your witch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/68b1eeca8472e63b6f0a7c3a75b40af1.avif?t=1784209700\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras_big/68b1eeca8472e63b6f0a7c3a75b40af1.avif?t=1784209700 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control your army of witches...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over the world by moving your armies to control strategic resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/06dd998d9a64b7c828f861ce212dad04.poster.avif?t=1784209700\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/06dd998d9a64b7c828f861ce212dad04.webm?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/06dd998d9a64b7c828f861ce212dad04.mp4?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...And then choose a battle to join on the front lines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/d486286705134cd8e788a0bd4e02b387.poster.avif?t=1784209700\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/d486286705134cd8e788a0bd4e02b387.webm?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/d486286705134cd8e788a0bd4e02b387.mp4?t=1784209700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAUSE MAYHEM AND CRUSH YOUR ENEMIES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture all of the bases or reduce the opponents reinforcements to 0 before they do the same to you.  The opening state of the battle depends on how many soldiers you send to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849050/extras/f0d0275c195a74bfd0facdc53603df44.poster.avif?t=1784209700\" width=540 height=360 ><sourc